# Completed ShoutOuts audit trail

Patron-facing history is not itself a GRC control name. It supports the record those controls expect.

- **SOC 2** CC7.2 / CC6.1: log user activity and changes. Completed club-approved ShoutOuts are the patron-visible copy of that trail.
- **ISO/IEC 27001:2022** A.8.15 logging, A.5.28 evidence, A.5.33 protection of records: archive must not delete the source row.
- **PCI DSS** Req. 10: log payment-related actions. Store order id, amount, status, and time. Never store card numbers.
- **GDPR** Art. 5(2) accountability and Art. 15 access: the patron can see their own history. Archive is retention, not erasure.
- **NIST 800-53** AU-2 / AU-3 / AU-11: who, what, when, outcome, retained.

## Portal wiring (My ShoutOuts)

Main tab: **My ShoutOuts** only (Templates is a sub-tab, not a top-level portal tab).

| Sub-tab | Contents |
|---|---|
| Pending ShoutOuts | Not yet club-approved (`pending`, `pending_approval`, preview/unpaid, needs_revision). Paid-but-unapproved stays here. Diagnose stays here only. |
| Completed ShoutOuts | Club-approved / live / ended / finished / refunded / rejected. Leaves Pending on approve or reject. **Not** `complianceArchived`. Actions: Re-Use, Archive, Save as my template (only if `IsModifiable=1`). |
| Archive | Compressed copies from Completed. Text + optional JPEG media under `shoutouts/{uid}/archives/`. Removed from Completed display. |
| My ShoutOut Templates | Patron template variants + community variants. Only when base template `IsModifiable=1` (background modifiable). |

Retention for Completed: last **60 days**, plus up to **10** ShoutOuts that include media. Pending is always shown. Archived rows leave Completed immediately.

**Master Admin compliance** (separate from patron Archive): see `.cursor/rules/design-notes-master-admin-shoutouts.mdc` — `shoutoutComplianceLogs`, 7-year metadata, 90-day media purge, ShoutOuts → Completed log + Retention.

**Approve must keep the shoutout document.** Club Admin / SMS approve writes `liveContent` and sets `shoutouts/{id}.status = approved` — it must **not** delete the shoutout. Deleting was why Completed looked empty for patrons (including after paid approval). Legacy paid orders whose docs were deleted are reconstructed from `serviceOrders` into Completed.

Collection `patronShoutoutArchives` is create-once, owner-read, no update or delete. Archive writes a compressed snapshot + optional Storage JPEG, then sets `shoutouts/{id}.complianceArchived = true` so Completed hides it. The shoutout document stays (audit). Video archives keep the original URL link (no re-encode).

**Re-Use ShoutOut** stores `sessionStorage FLOQR_REUSE_SHOUTOUT` and opens Search (`start=shoutout`) with location/template; `patron-app.js` applies wording/media when the editor opens.

**IsModifiable** (0|1) is required on every template (normalized from / mirrored to `backgroundEditable`). Tags alone are not enough. Save as my template is gated on this flag.

## Receipts

Paid ShoutOut **receipts must stay in FloqR Inbox** (email/SMS/PDF as configured). Inbox CTA deep-links to `patron-portal.html?tab=shoutouts` (My ShoutOuts). Do not remove Inbox delivery in favor of the portal list alone.
